# SonicBoom golden greedy token stream — test_qwen2_generate (batched
# prefill + decode). SonicBoom's own output, pinned so a token-stream
# change shows up as a diff. Regenerate with:
#     test_qwen2_generate --write-goldens
# The cuda line is device-specific (the device kernels are not
# device-invariant: the decode-attention split-KV grid is sized from the
# SM count), so it is only compared on the device that recorded it.
model DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B-Q4_K_M.gguf
device NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 sm 20 cc 8.6
steps 64
cpu 279 12884 374 6303 11 279 17951 374 19300 11 279 16876 9920 389 279 30184 11 279 12884 374 6303 11 279 17951 374 19300 11 279 16876 9920 389 279 30184 11 279 12884 374 6303 11 279 17951 374 19300 11 279 16876 9920 389 279 30184 11 279 12884 374 6303 11 279 17951 374 19300 11 279 16876 9920
cuda 279 12884 374 6303 11 279 17951 374 19300 11 279 7015 374 3347 11 279 17951 374 13675 11 279 17951 374 6233 11 279 17951 374 13675 11 279 17951 374 6233 11 279 17951 374 13675 11 279 17951 374 6233 11 279 17951 374 13675 11 279 17951 374 6233 11 279 17951 374 13675 11 279 17951 374 6233
